Error [E1110]: `.task` must be called on the active taskgroup handle `inner`, not `g`
  --> tests/ui/taskgroup_outside.jet:8:18
    |
  8 |             x @= g.task { one() }
    |                  ^
 Why: each `taskgroup` block owns spawns on its bound handle only
 Fix: write `inner.task { … }` inside `taskgroup inner { … }`
